-- h_logout.mix — legacy /logout. Under the unified maild login the real sign-out
-- is the profile widget's POST /auth/logout (webd built-in, clears the sealed
-- cosmix_session + revokes the maild token). A GET can't clear an HttpOnly sealed
-- cookie, so this vestigial endpoint just bounces home rather than 404 a bookmark.
function logout_main()
  return redirect("/")
end
